  "Cap: Dog and Turtle use the base Cap (AST-053_CrewCap.fbx). All others use Cap_EarsUp (AST-053_CrewCap_EarsUp.fbx), same HatAttachment.",
  "UV channel 1 'UVMap' = KitchenPack atlas (restaurantbits_texture.png). Channel 2 'UVPaint' = clean non-overlapping unwrap on one 512x512 sheet per animal: Head v 0.375-1 (full width), Ears u 0-0.5 / v 0-0.375 (Shell_Turtle there for the turtle), Tail u 0.5-0.75, extras (Beak_Owl) u 0.75-1. Roblox reads only the first UV channel: for painted textures make UVPaint the first channel on export."
